{"event": "tool_ranking_prompt_file", "payload": "tool_ranking_prompt.md"}
{"event": "tool_ranking_prompt", "payload": "You are ranking Gmail MCP tools for a user request.\n\nGoal:\n- Choose the most relevant tools first.\n- Prefer read/search/list tools when the user asks to view or summarize email.\n- Prefer send/draft tools only when the user explicitly asks to write or send mail.\n- Prefer modify/delete tools only when the user explicitly asks to change or remove data.\n\nInstructions:\n- Consider every tool in the catalog.\n- Order tools from most useful to least useful.\n- Keep reasoning short and concrete.\n\nUse this exact shape: {\"rankedTools\":[{\"name\":\"tool_name\",\"reason\":\"why\"}],\"skipped\":[\"tool_name: reason\",\"tool_name: reason\"]}\n\nRules:\n- Evaluate ALL tools in the catalog.\n- rankedTools: tools that ARE relevant, ordered from most to least important.\n- skipped: tools that are NOT relevant, with one-sentence reasons.\n- Do not invent tool names.\n- Use tool name and description only.\n\nUser request:\nread all emails from 4/22/2026\n\nTool catalog (JSON):\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"send_email\",\n    \"description\": \"Sends a new email\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"draft_email\",\n    \"description\": \"Draft a new email\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"read_email\",\n    \"description\": \"Retrieves the content of a specific email\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"search_emails\",\n    \"description\": \"Searches for emails using Gmail search syntax\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"modify_email\",\n    \"description\": \"Modifies email labels (move to different folders)\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"delete_email\",\n    \"description\": \"Permanently deletes an email\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"list_email_labels\",\n    \"description\": \"Retrieves all available Gmail labels\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"batch_modify_emails\",\n    \"description\": \"Modifies labels for multiple emails in batches\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"batch_delete_emails\",\n    \"description\": \"Permanently deletes multiple emails in batches\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"create_label\",\n    \"description\": \"Creates a new Gmail label\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"update_label\",\n    \"description\": \"Updates an existing Gmail label\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"delete_label\",\n    \"description\": \"Deletes a Gmail label\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"get_or_create_label\",\n    \"description\": \"Gets an existing label by name or creates it if it doesn't exist\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"create_filter\",\n    \"description\": \"Creates a new Gmail filter with custom criteria and actions\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"list_filters\",\n    \"description\": \"Retrieves all Gmail filters\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"get_filter\",\n    \"description\": \"Gets details of a specific Gmail filter\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"delete_filter\",\n    \"description\": \"Deletes a Gmail filter\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"create_filter_from_template\",\n    \"description\": \"Creates a filter using a pre-defined template for common scenarios\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"download_attachment\",\n    \"description\": \"Downloads an email attachment to a specified location\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {}\n  }\n]\n\n\nReturn JSON only. No markdown.\n\nUse this exact shape: {\"rankedTools\":[{\"name\":\"tool_name\",\"reason\":\"why\"}]}\n\nOnly include tool names from the provided catalog."}
{"event": "tool_ranking_response", "payload": {"rankedTools": [{"name": "search_emails", "reason": "The user wants to view emails from a specific date, making search the most direct and relevant tool."}, {"name": "read_email", "reason": "If the search returns specific emails, this tool would be needed to retrieve and view their content."}, {"name": "list_email_labels", "reason": "While not directly needed, listing labels helps understand the email structure, which is useful for viewing/summarizing."}, {"name": "download_attachment", "reason": "If the emails contain attachments, this tool is necessary to access the content."}, {"name": "list_filters", "reason": "Listing filters is a general viewing/information task, making it slightly more relevant than label management."}, {"name": "get_filter", "reason": "Retrieving details of a specific filter is a viewing task, useful for understanding email organization."}, {"name": "get_or_create_label", "reason": "This tool is for label management, but viewing labels is part of understanding the email structure."}, {"name": "list_labels", "reason": "Listing labels is a general viewing/information task, useful for understanding email organization."}], "skipped": ["send_email: The user is reading emails, not sending them.", "draft_email: The user is reading emails, not drafting them.", "modify_email: The user is reading emails, not modifying them.", "delete_email: The user is reading emails, not deleting them.", "batch_modify_emails: The user is reading emails, not modifying multiple emails.", "batch_delete_emails: The user is reading emails, not deleting multiple emails.", "create_label: The user is reading emails, not creating labels.", "update_label: The user is reading emails, not updating labels.", "delete_label: The user is reading emails, not deleting labels.", "create_filter: The user is reading emails, not creating filters.", "create_filter_from_template: The user is reading emails, not creating filters.", "batch_modify_emails: The user is reading emails, not modifying multiple emails.", "batch_delete_emails: The user is reading emails, not deleting multiple emails."]}}
