f this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Aryan Thomare*\r\n>\r\n> Apr 13, 2026, 14:44 EDT\r\n> Hi Maria,\r\n> Thank you for your help. I do see the contract now!\r\n> I did want to discuss some of the terms of the contract. Would it be best\r\n> to outline my questions/concerns in an email or discuss them in some other\r\n> way?\r\n>\r\n> Thanks,\r\n> Aryan\r\n>\r\n> *Maria Naredo* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 13, 2026, 13:24 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> Thanks so much for your patience!\r\n> You should have received a notification that your employment contract is\r\n> ready to be reviewed in DocuSign.\r\n>\r\n> Here is some additional information what your next steps look like:\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>    - Click on the DocuSign link and review the contract in its entirety.\r\n>    - If you would like to negotiate or discuss changes with Derivative\r\n>    Path on the terms of your contract, please reach out to us.  If applicable,\r\n>    you will be notified again once the updated contract is ready for your\r\n>    review.\r\n>    - Once ready, please proceed with signing the contract in DocuSign.\r\n>    - Once the contract is signed you will be able to access a fully\r\n>    executed version in the Platform.  I will send you another email to outline\r\n>    the remaining steps for your onboarding (payroll enrollment, expenses,\r\n>    etc.).\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach out.\r\n>\r\n> Kind Regards,\r\n> Maria.\r\n>\r\n> Mar\u00eda Naredo\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Maria Naredo* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 13, 2026, 11:50 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> Thank you so much for completing your setup and uploading your documents.\r\n> Everything looks good!\r\n> I also want to thank you for your patience. We were finalizing your\r\n> employment contract with Derivative, and I expect it to be ready throughout\r\n> the day. I'll reach out with instructions on how to review it and sign it\r\n> very soon.\r\n>\r\n> Best,\r\n>\r\n> Mar\u00eda Naredo\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Aryan Thomare*\r\n>\r\n> Apr 11, 2026, 18:55 EDT\r\n> Hi Mar\u00eda,\r\n>\r\n> Thank you for reaching out! I submitted my documents a few days ago and\r\n> haven't heard anything back. Is there anything else I need to do for the\r\n> Internal verification?\r\n>\r\n> Thanks,\r\n> Aryan\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Maria Naredo* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 1, 2026, 12:07 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> My name is Maria Naredo from the G-P Global HR Operations Team. As you may\r\n> know from *Derivative Path,* G-P will be your Employer of Record. This\r\n> means we will prepare your employment agreement, place you on our locally\r\n> compliant payroll, and assign your services to Derivative Path.\r\n>\r\n> To move forward with your employment agreement, please complete the\r\n> following steps.\r\n>\r\n> *Step 1: Complete Your G-P Platform Profile*\r\n> You will receive (or have received) an invitation to our secure G-P\r\n> Platform. Please log in and fill out the requested personal information.\r\n> You'll also need to upload valid documentation to prove you are eligible to\r\n> work in Canada.\r\n>\r\n> Valid documents include:\r\n>\r\n>    - Canadian Passport\r\n>    - Birth Certificate\r\n>    - Citizenship Card\r\n>    - Permanent Resident Card\r\n>    - Open Work Permit\r\n>\r\n> Please note: If you upload a document without a photo (like a Birth\r\n> Certificate), you must also upload a second form of ID with your photo\r\n> (e.g., passport, driver's license, or provincial health card). A driver's\r\n> license or provincial health card on its own is not sufficient for work\r\n> authorization.\r\n>\r\n> *Step 2: Confirm you have a Social Insurance Number (SIN)*\r\n> To legally work in Canada, you must have a valid 9-digit Social Insurance\r\n> Number (SIN). If you do not have one, please let me know right away. This\r\n> will be required during your payroll enrollment, after your contract has\r\n> been fully signed.\r\n>\r\n> *Next Steps*\r\n> Once you've completed your initial enrollment in the G-P Platform, here's\r\n> what happens next:\r\n> *Internal Verification: *The G-P team will quickly verify your\r\n> information, typically within 24 hours.\r\n> *Contract Review:* Once the verification is complete, you'll be notified\r\n> by email that your employment contract is ready for review and signature\r\n> via DocuSign. I will be available for any questions you may have throughout\r\n> the process.\r\n> I have attached the Onboarding Manual - Canada, which provides a detailed\r\n> guide to this entire process.\r\n>\r\n> Please let me know if you have any questions. I look forward to working\r\n> together to get you onboarded!\r\n>\r\n> Sincerely,\r\n>\r\n> Mar\u00eda Naredo\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n> Upcoming OOO: Friday, April 3rd.\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> Attachment(s)\r\n> Canada_Onboarding_Manual_EN-Updated.pdf\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/attachments/token/byMFiTJ5S91ZKIg818PFbyqdT/?name=Canada_Onboarding_Manual_EN-Updated.pdf>\r\n>\r\n> The request (#810533\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/requests/810533>) has been\r\n> updated.\r\n> To add additional comments, reply to this email.\r\n> [ZPRG9M-4PYZW]\r\n>\r\n", "id": "lc_06a0334b-f0c0-40e2-9533-70f2fce9938a"}]}}
