{"event": "tool_return", "payload": {"name": "read_email", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Thread ID: 19db727809ce03ee\nSubject: Many files were recently deleted from your OneDrive\nFrom: OneDrive <no-reply@onedrive.com>\nTo: aryanthomare@gmail.com\nDate: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 21:45:10 +0000\n\n[Note: This email is HTML-formatted. Plain text version not available.]\n\n<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en-us\" xmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\"><head>\r\n    <!--[if gte mso 9]> <xml> <o:OfficeDocumentSettings> <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch> </o:OfficeDocumentSettings> </xml><![endif]-->\r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex, nofollow\" />\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"date=no\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"address=no\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"email=no\" />\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\r\n     <!--[if gte mso 9]> <style>b{font-weight: normal;font-family: 'Segoe UI Semibold', 'Segoe UI', SUWSB, Arial, sans-serif;}\t</style> <![endif]-->\r\n    <title>Files are permanently removed from your OneDrive recycle bin 30 days after they were deleted</title>\r\n</head>\r\n<body style=\"padding: 0;margin: 0;color: #ffffff\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;margin: 0;padding: 0;mso-table-lspace: 0pt;mso-table-rspace: 0;-ms-text-size-adjust: auto;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;min-width: 100%\">\r\n        <tbody><tr style=\"mso-line-height-rule: exactly\">\r\n   