 font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; width: 100%;\">\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: center;\">What people have to say...</p>\r\n                            </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                  </table>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </table>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\">\r\n      <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" width=\"512\" class=\"st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table\" style=\"width: 512px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 16px 33px;\">\r\n            <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#A8D4FF\" class=\"border-radius-ts\" style=\"padding-right: 17px; padding-left: 17px;\">\r\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"412\" class=\"st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width\" style=\"width: 412px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"412\" class=\"border-radius\">\r\n                        <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" class=\"img-w-56 st-dynamic-doqcivpsetr2v\" style=\"padding-top: 12px; width: 100%;\"><img border=\"0\" valign=\"top\" width=\"56\" src=\"https://www.emailimagecdntsxk.com/nh0q6y2meb/en_us/images/69d3e63ce63f8-1775494716.9431.png\" height=\"56\" alt=\"Logo of Inc\" title=\"Logo of Inc\" class=\"st-mobile-width-constraint\" style=\"border: 0px; display: block; width: 56px; max-width: 100%;\"> </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #191919; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-top: 8px; width: 100%;\">\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: center;\">Inc</p>\r\n                            </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                  </table>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#A8D4FF\" class=\"border-radius-bs\" style=\"padding-bottom: 12px;\">\r\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                      <td width=\"11\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-left: 10px; width: 11px;\">\r\n                        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"> </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                      <td width=\"403\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width: 403px;\">\r\n                        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #191919; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 20px; padding-top: 8px; padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; width: 100%;\">\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: center;\">&ldquo;The book lays out how AI can strip away many of the traditional barriers to starting a business&#8212;capital, gatekeepers, specialized expertise&#8212;and replace them with tools that let individuals build, test, and scale ideas on their own terms.&rdquo;</p>\r\n                            </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                      <td width=\"12\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"padding-right: 10px; width: 12px;\">\r\n                        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"> </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                  </table>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </table>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\">\r\n      <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" width=\"512\" class=\"st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table\" style=\"width: 512px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 16px 33px;\">\r\n            <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#A8D4FF\" class=\"border-radius-ts\" style=\"padding-right: 17px; padding-left: 17px;\">\r\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"412\" class=\"st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width\" style=\"width: 412px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"412\" class=\"border-radius\">\r\n                        <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" class=\"img-w-56 st-dynamic-doqcivpsetr2v\" style=\"padding-top: 12px; width: 100%;\"><img border=\"0\" valign=\"top\" width=\"56\" src=\"https://www.emailimagecdntsxk.com/nh0q6y2meb/en_us/images/69d3e60f62eda-1775494671.4052.png\" height=\"56\" alt=\"Logo of Fortune\" title=\"Logo of Fortune\" class=\"st-mobile-width-constraint\" style=\"border: 0px; display: block; width: 56px; max-width: 100%;\"> </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #191919; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-top: 8px; width: 100%;\">\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: center;\">Fortune</p>\r\n                            </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                  </table>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#A8D4FF\" class=\"border-radius-bs\" style=\"padding-bottom: 12px;\">\r\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                      <td width=\"11\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-left: 10px; width: 11px;\">\r\n                        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"> </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                      <td width=\"403\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width: 403px;\">\r\n                        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #191919; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 20px; padding-top: 8px; padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; width: 100%;\">\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: center;\">&ldquo;The book draws on LinkedIn data and case studies of early adopters to offer what they&nbsp;call&nbsp;a &ldquo;how-to-human-with-AI&rdquo; playbook that tries to counter the &ldquo;fatalism&rdquo; that dominates most conversations about AI&rsquo;s effect on employment.&rdquo;</p>\r\n                            </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                      <td width=\"12\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"padding-right: 10px; width: 12px;\">\r\n                        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"> </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                  </table>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </table>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\">\r\n      <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" width=\"512\" class=\"st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table\" style=\"width: 512px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 16px 33px;\">\r\n            <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#A8D4FF\" class=\"border-radius-ts\" style=\"padding-right: 17px; padding-left: 17px;\">\r\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"412\" class=\"st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width\" style=\"width: 412px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"412\" class=\"border-radius\">\r\n                        <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" class=\"img-w-56 st-dynamic-doqcivpsetr2v\" style=\"padding-top: 12px; width: 100%;\"><img border=\"0\" valign=\"top\" width=\"56\" src=\"https://www.emailimagecdntsxk.com/nh0q6y2meb/en_us/images/69d65ada5a705-1775655642.3704.png\" height=\"56\" alt=\"Logo of The Times\" title=\"Logo of The Times\" class=\"st-mobile-width-constraint\" style=\"border: 0px; display: block; width: 56px; max-width: 100%;\"> </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #191919; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-top: 8px; width: 100%;\">\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: center;\">The Times</p>\r\n                            </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                  </table>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#A8D4FF\" class=\"border-radius-bs\" style=\"padding-bottom: 12px;\">\r\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                      <td width=\"11\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-left: 10px; width: 11px;\">\r\n                        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"> </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                      <td width=\"403\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width: 403px;\">\r\n                        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #191919; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 20px; padding-top: 8px; padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; width: 100%;\">\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: center;\">&ldquo;Roslansky and Raman take a more constructive view, suggesting AI can be positive for staff in almost every role, allowing workers to automate the mundane and focus on higher-value work that requires human input.&rdquo;</p>\r\n                            </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                      <td width=\"12\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"padding-right: 10px; width: 12px;\">\r\n                        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"> </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                  </table>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </table>\r\n       