{"event": "tool_return", "payload": {"name": "read_email", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Thread ID: 19db67c7023d98ea\nSubject: [aryanthomare/MCPGmail] Migrate project to LangChain (MCP adapters, ChatOllama, LangGraph ReAct agent) (PR #1)\nFrom: Copilot <notifications@github.com>\nTo: \"aryanthomare/MCPGmail\" <MCPGmail@noreply.github.com>\nDate: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 11:38:21 -0700\n\nReplaces the raw `mcp` SDK + `openai` SDK usage with the LangChain ecosystem across both Python and TypeScript entry points.\r\n\r\n## Python\r\n\r\n- **`requirements.txt`**: `mcp` + `openai` \u2192 `langchain`, `langchain-ollama`, `langchain-mcp-adapters`, `langgraph`\r\n- **`list_gmail_tools.py`**: `stdio_client`/`ClientSession` \u2192 `MultiServerMCPClient`; `OpenAI` client \u2192 `ChatOllama`; added `get_tool_schema()` to extract input schemas from `BaseTool` objects (replacing direct `.inputSchema` access)\r\n- **`ollama_openai_chat.py`**: entire manual plan\u2192execute multi-round loop replaced by `create_react_agent`; `--prompt` invokes `ChatOllama` directly, `--mcp-request` runs the full ReAct agent\r\n\r\n```python\r\nasync with MultiServerMCPClient({&quot;gmail&quot;: {&quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;, &quot;args&quot;: [...], &quot;transport&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;, ...}}) as mcp_client:\r\n    tools = await mcp_client.get_tools()\r\n    agent = create_react_agent(ChatOllama(model=model, base_url=base_url), tools)\r\n    response = await agent.ainvoke({&quot;messages&quot;: [HumanMessage(content=request)]})\r\n```\r\n\r\n## TypeScript\r\n\r\n- **`src/index.ts`**: `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` + raw `fetch` \u2192 `@langchain/mcp-adapters`, `@langchain/ollama`, `@langchain/langgraph`; heuristic ranking and manual prompt loop replaced by `createReactAgent`\r\n- **`package.json`**: `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` \u2192 `@langchain/core`, `@langchain/ollama`, `@langchain/mcp-adapters`, `@langchain/langgraph`\r\n\r\n## Housekeeping\r\n\r\n- `.gitignore`: added `node_modules`, `dist`, `__pycache__`, `*.pyc`\r\n- `README.md`: updated env vars (`OLLAMA_MODEL`, `OLLAMA_BASE_URL`), usage examples, and architecture overview\r\nYou can view, comment on, or merge this pull request online at:\r\n\r\n  https://github.com/aryanthomare/MCPGmail/pull/1?email_source=notifications&amp;email_token=AL3GCSGRNMI47653LAUFXPT4XEGR3A5CNFSNUABEM5UWIORPF5TWS5BNNB2WEL2QOVWGYUTFOF2WK43UF4ZTKNRZGAYDMOBQGOTHEZLBONXW5JTBONZWSZ3OUVSXMZLOOSWXA4S7N5YGK3S7MNWGSY3L\r\n\r\n-- Commit Summary --\r\n\r\n  * feat: migrate project to LangChain (langchain-mcp-adapters, ChatOllama, LangGraph ReAct agent)\r\n  * chore: add node_modules and dist to .gitignore and untrack them\r\n  * fix: await get_tools(), simplify TS message loop, fix args duplication\r\n\r\n-- File Changes --\r\n\r\n    M .gitignore (6)\r\n    M README.md (108)\r\n    A __pycache__/list_gmail_tools.cpython-312.pyc (0)\r\n    A __pycache__/ollama_openai_chat.cpython-312.pyc (0)\r\n    D dist/index.js (183)\r\n    M list_gmail_tools.py (106)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/esbuild (16)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/esbuild.cmd (17)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/esbuild.ps1 (28)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/node-which (16)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/node-which.cmd (17)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/node-which.ps1 (28)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/tsc (16)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/tsc.cmd (17)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/tsc.ps1 (28)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/tsserver (16)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/tsserver.cmd (17)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/tsserver.ps1 (28)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/tsx (16)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/tsx.cmd (17)\r\n    D node_modules/.bin/tsx.ps1 (28)\r\n    D node_modules/.package-lock.json (1264)\r\n    D node_modules/@esbuild/win32-x64/README.md (3)\r\n    D node_modules/@esbuild/win32-x64/esbuild.exe (0)\r\n    D node_modules/@esbuild/win32-x64/package.json (20)\r\n    D node_modules/@hono/node-server/LICENSE (21)\r\n    D node_modules/@hono/node-server/README.md (358)\r\n    D node_modules/@hono/node-s