{"event": "agent_message", "payload": {"type": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Thread ID: 19db75b30da1ca97\nSubject: An extra layer of security is coming to your account\nFrom: LinkedIn <security-noreply@linkedin.com>\nTo: Aryan Thomare <aryanthomare@gmail.com>\nDate: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 22:41:38 +0000 (UTC)\n\nTwo-factor authentication is coming to your account\r\n\r\nAryan,\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ll start rolling out SMS-based two-step verification (2FA) on your LinkedIn account on Apr 29, 2026, using your phone number +*******0199.\r\n\r\nWhy LinkedIn is doing this\r\n\r\nWith 2FA enabled, your account gains an extra layer of security, blocking up to 99.9%(https://www.linkedin.com/e/v2?urlhash=R0l-&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Emicrosoft%2Ecom%2Fen-us%2Fsecurity%2Fblog%2F2019%2F08%2F20%2Fone-simple-action-you-can-take-to-prevent-99-9-percent-of-account-attacks%2F&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice%3Blk9LexD9T7aGAn%2BrL12qAA%3D%3D&midToken=AQEQOJB9PzQk_Q&midSig=2KcHk5Nk5NUYc1&ek=email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice&e=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&eid=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&m=tg_b&ts=mfa_stats_learn_more&li=0&t=plh) of unauthorized access attempts.\r\n\r\nHow it works\r\n\r\nOnce enabled, you\u2019ll enter a verification code sent to this number whenever you sign in from a new device, browser, or incognito window. Learn more(https://www.linkedin.com/e/v2?urlhash=WSuz&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Elinkedin%2Ecom%2Fhelp%2Flinkedin%2Fanswer%2Fa10357073%3Fhcppcid%3Dsearch&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice%3Blk9LexD9T7aGAn%2BrL12qAA%3D%3D&midToken=AQEQOJB9PzQk_Q&midSig=2KcHk5Nk5NUYc1&ek=email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice&e=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&eid=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&m=tg_b&ts=two_factor_learn_more&li=0&t=plh)\r\n\r\nYou can opt out here(https://www.linkedin.com/two-factor/opt-out?profileId=ACoAADMHusgBnhPN9dedCoRXj5PIJGJiQH8qZps&consentFlowType=TwoFactorAuthConsentFlowType_AUTOMATIC_ENABLEMENT&hashOfPhoneHandle=AYoNdWYFzG9oO3wSSOaSYepTgcXN&id=10380954&expiredAt=AgHBSVes-jlQ1AAAAZ23Wss9JLg1o0czSMzj3xGanustCgqLpR0cnfmoPc_mXi0). 2FA is optional and you can manage it anytime in Settings(https://www.linkedin.com/e/v2?urlhash=2gvz&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Elinkedin%2Ecom%2Fmypreferences%2Fm%2Ftwo-factor-authentication&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice%3Blk9LexD9T7aGAn%2BrL12qAA%3D%3D&midToken=AQEQOJB9PzQk_Q&midSig=2KcHk5Nk5NUYc1&ek=email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice&e=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&eid=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&m=tg_b&ts=settings_manage_two_factor_verifications&li=0&t=plh).\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n\r\nThis email was intended for Aryan Thomare (University of Michigan Computer Engineering | Machine Learning @ Derivative Path Inc.)\r\nLearn why we included this: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/4788?lang=en&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice%3Blk9LexD9T7aGAn%2BrL12qAA%3D%3D&midToken=AQEQOJB9PzQk_Q&midSig=2KcHk5Nk5NUYc1&trk=eml-email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice-SecurityHelp-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice-SecurityHelp-0-textfooterglimmer-null-e5q5e0~moan0e2k~iv-null-null&eid=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv\r\nYou are receiving LinkedIn notification emails.\r\n\r\nHelp: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/67?lang=en&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice%3Blk9LexD9T7aGAn%2BrL12qAA%3D%3D&midToken=AQEQOJB9PzQk_Q&midSig=2KcHk5Nk5NUYc1&trk=eml-email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice-help-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice-help-0-textfooterglimmer-null-e5q5e0~moan0e2k~iv-null-null&eid=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv\r\n\r\n\u00a9 2026 LinkedIn Corporation, 1zwnj000 West Maude Avenue, Sunnyvale, CA 94085.\r\nLinkedIn and the LinkedIn logo are registered trademarks of LinkedIn.", "id": "lc_3b88c63d-5e8b-4a29-9a71-b2fa08f35137"}]}}
{"event": "tool_return", "payload": {"name": "read_email", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Thread ID: 19db75b30da1ca97\nSubject: An extra layer of security is coming to your account\nFrom: LinkedIn <security-noreply@linkedin.com>\nTo: Aryan Thomare <aryanthomare@gmail.com>\nDate: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 22:41:38 +0000 (UTC)\n\nTwo-factor authentication is coming to your account\r\n\r\nAryan,\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ll start rolling out SMS-based two-step verification (2FA) on your LinkedIn account on Apr 29, 2026, using your phone number +*******0199.\r\n\r\nWhy LinkedIn is doing this\r\n\r\nWith 2FA enabled, your account gains an extra layer of security, blocking up to 99.9%(https://www.linkedin.com/e/v2?urlhash=R0l-&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Emicrosoft%2Ecom%2Fen-us%2Fsecurity%2Fblog%2F2019%2F08%2F20%2Fone-simple-action-you-can-take-to-prevent-99-9-percent-of-account-attacks%2F&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice%3Blk9LexD9T7aGAn%2BrL12qAA%3D%3D&midToken=AQEQOJB9PzQk_Q&midSig=2KcHk5Nk5NUYc1&ek=email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice&e=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&eid=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&m=tg_b&ts=mfa_stats_learn_more&li=0&t=plh) of unauthorized access attempts.\r\n\r\nHow it works\r\n\r\nOnce enabled, you\u2019ll enter a verification code sent to this number whenever you sign in from a new device, browser, or incognito window. Learn more(https://www.linkedin.com/e/v2?urlhash=WSuz&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Elinkedin%2Ecom%2Fhelp%2Flinkedin%2Fanswer%2Fa10357073%3Fhcppcid%3Dsearch&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice%3Blk9LexD9T7aGAn%2BrL12qAA%3D%3D&midToken=AQEQOJB9PzQk_Q&midSig=2KcHk5Nk5NUYc1&ek=email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice&e=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&eid=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&m=tg_b&ts=two_factor_learn_more&li=0&t=plh)\r\n\r\nYou can opt out here(https://www.linkedin.com/two-factor/opt-out?profileId=ACoAADMHusgBnhPN9dedCoRXj5PIJGJiQH8qZps&consentFlowType=TwoFactorAuthConsentFlowType_AUTOMATIC_ENABLEMENT&hashOfPhoneHandle=AYoNdWYFzG9oO3wSSOaSYepTgcXN&id=10380954&expiredAt=AgHBSVes-jlQ1AAAAZ23Wss9JLg1o0czSMzj3xGanustCgqLpR0cnfmoPc_mXi0). 2FA is optional and you can manage it anytime in Settings(https://www.linkedin.com/e/v2?urlhash=2gvz&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Elinkedin%2Ecom%2Fmypreferences%2Fm%2Ftwo-factor-authentication&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice%3Blk9LexD9T7aGAn%2BrL12qAA%3D%3D&midToken=AQEQOJB9PzQk_Q&midSig=2KcHk5Nk5NUYc1&ek=email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice&e=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&eid=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv&m=tg_b&ts=settings_manage_two_factor_verifications&li=0&t=plh).\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n\r\nThis email was intended for Aryan Thomare (University of Michigan Computer Engineering | Machine Learning @ Derivative Path Inc.)\r\nLearn why we included this: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/4788?lang=en&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice%3Blk9LexD9T7aGAn%2BrL12qAA%3D%3D&midToken=AQEQOJB9PzQk_Q&midSig=2KcHk5Nk5NUYc1&trk=eml-email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice-SecurityHelp-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice-SecurityHelp-0-textfooterglimmer-null-e5q5e0~moan0e2k~iv-null-null&eid=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv\r\nYou are receiving LinkedIn notification emails.\r\n\r\nHelp: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/67?lang=en&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice%3Blk9LexD9T7aGAn%2BrL12qAA%3D%3D&midToken=AQEQOJB9PzQk_Q&midSig=2KcHk5Nk5NUYc1&trk=eml-email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice-help-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_mfa_auto_enablement_advance_notice-help-0-textfooterglimmer-null-e5q5e0~moan0e2k~iv-null-null&eid=e5q5e0-moan0e2k-iv\r\n\r\n\u00a9 2026 LinkedIn Corporation, 1zwnj000 West Maude Avenue, Sunnyvale, CA 94085.\r\nLinkedIn and the LinkedIn logo are registered trademarks of LinkedIn.", "id": "lc_3b88c63d-5e8b-4a29-9a71-b2fa08f35137"}]}}
{"event": "agent_message", "payload": {"type": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Thread ID: 19db65eeffc847c9\nSubject: Re: ACTION REQUIRED - Derivative Path - Contract Review & Signature\nFrom: Aryan Thomare <aryanthomare@gmail.com>\nTo: Support <support@g-p.com>\nDate: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 18:06:02 -0400\n\nHello,\r\n\r\nI had a few small questions regarding the contract:\r\n\r\n*1)* In the beginning section of the contract, it is written that \"In this\r\nAgreement, the term \"the Client\" means Derivative Path.\" But in Schedule B\r\nit is written that \"Globalization Partners (Canada), ULC (\u201cG-P\u201d) (the\r\n\u201cCompany\u201d) and Notion International(the \u201cClient\u201d)\". Is this an error or\r\nintentional?\r\n\r\n*2) *On the first page, it is written: \"Notwithstanding that fact your\r\nemployment with the Company will commence on May 11, 2026, for the purposes\r\nof this Agreement the Company will provide you with service back to August\r\n27, 2025.\" What does the service refer to provided refer to and why is it\r\nin reference to August 27th\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nAryan\r\n\r\nOn Wed, Apr 22, 2026 at 2:06\u202fPM Support <support@g-p.com> wrote:\r\n\r\n> ##- Please type your reply above this line -##\r\n>\r\n> *Tania Rocha* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 22, 2026, 14:06 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> Thanks so much for your patience!\r\n>\r\n> You should have received a notification that your revised employment\r\n> contract is ready to be reviewed in DocuSign.\r\n>\r\n> Here is some additional information on what your next steps look like:\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>    - Click on the DocuSign link and review the contract in its entirety.\r\n>    - If you would like to negotiate or discuss changes with Derivative\r\n>    Path on the terms of your contract, please reach out to us.  If applicable,\r\n>    you will be notified again once the updated contract is ready for your\r\n>    review.\r\n>    - Once ready, please proceed with signing the contract in DocuSign.\r\n>    - Once the contract is signed you will be able to access a fully\r\n>    executed version in the Platform.  I will send you another email to outline\r\n>    the remaining steps for your onboarding (payroll enrollment, expenses,\r\n>    etc.).\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach out.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n>\r\n> Tania Rocha\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Tania Rocha* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 20, 2026, 17:02 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> We kindly ask you to reach out to Gina Norwood directly as Derivative Path\r\n> will need to connect with you to over your questions.\r\n>\r\n> Thank you.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n>\r\n> Tania Rocha\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Aryan Thomare*\r\n>\r\n> Apr 20, 2026, 16:56 EDT\r\n> Hello,\r\n> Hope you are all doing well! I wanted to see if there was any progress\r\n> made or any clarifications for the questions that I listed earlier.\r\n>\r\n> Thanks,\r\n> Aryan\r\n>\r\n> *Maria Naredo* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 17, 2026, 12:39 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> I hope you\u2019re doing well.\r\n>\r\n> I wanted to let you know that I\u2019ll be out of the office starting today and\r\n> will return on April 27. In the meantime, my colleague, Tania Rocha, will\r\n> be available to assist you with any questions regarding your contract or\r\n> the onboarding process.\r\n>\r\n> Please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out to her if you need any support.\r\n>\r\n> Thank you, and have a great rest of your week!\r\n>\r\n> Best regards,\r\n>\r\n> Mar\u00eda Naredo\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n> Upcoming OOO: Friday 17 to Friday 24\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Maria Naredo* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 14, 2026, 13:58 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> I'm adding Gina Norwood to our ticket so that she's aware of your\r\n> questions. They will connect with you to go over them.\r\n>\r\n> Thanks,\r\n>\r\n> Mar\u00eda Naredo\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Maria Naredo* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 14, 2026, 13:40 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> Thank you for sharing your questions.  I believe that Derivative Path is\r\n> best positioned to provide detailed guidance about your salary and what\r\n> happens after the initial 6 months. I will ask Gina Norwood to connect with\r\n> you directly to discuss this further.\r\n> Once you\u2019ve had a chance to speak with her, please let me know. I will\r\n> also follow up on my end to confirm whether any updates to the contract are\r\n> needed.\r\n>\r\n> Thank you again, and please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out if anything else\r\n> comes up.\r\n>\r\n> Best regards,\r\n>\r\n> Mar\u00eda Naredo\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Aryan Thomare*\r\n>\r\n> Apr 14, 2026, 12:35 EDT\r\n> Hi Maria,\r\n> Thank you for your quick response!\r\n>\r\n> First, I wanted to ask if there is room to negotiate the salary for this\r\n> 6-month term. My hourly wage while interning ($25 USD/hour -> $35 CAD/hour)\r\n> with the team was higher than the hourly equivalent of the current salary\r\n> ($25 CAD/hour), so I wanted to see if there is flexibility to revisit the\r\n> compensation.\r\n>\r\n> Second, since this period was described as a \u201ctrial period,\u201d I would love\r\n> to learn more about what comes after the initial 6 months. Specifically,\r\n> could you share any information about:\r\n>\r\n> The typical salary range following the contract period\r\n> What the transition to a longer-term role usually looks like\r\n> Any expectations or milestones used to evaluate the extension or conversion\r\n>\r\n> I appreciate any guidance you can provide and am very excited about\r\n> continuing with the team.\r\n>\r\n> Thank you so much for your help!\r\n>\r\n> Best regards,\r\n> Aryan\r\n>\r\n> *Maria Naredo* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 13, 2026, 15:06 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> Sure! Please send your questions via email so that we can review who is\r\n> better suited to help with your questions, whether Derivative Path or G-P.\r\n>\r\n> Thanks so much!\r\n>\r\n> Best,\r\n>\r\n> Mar\u00eda Naredo\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Aryan Thomare*\r\n>\r\n> Apr 13, 2026, 14:44 EDT\r\n> Hi Maria,\r\n> Thank you for your help. I do see the contract now!\r\n> I did want to discuss some of the terms of the contract. Would it be best\r\n> to outline my questions/concerns in an email or discuss them in some other\r\n> way?\r\n>\r\n> Thanks,\r\n> Aryan\r\n>\r\n> *Maria Naredo* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 13, 2026, 13:24 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> Thanks so much for your patience!\r\n> You should have received a notification that your employment contract is\r\n> ready to be reviewed in DocuSign.\r\n>\r\n> Here is some additional information what your next steps look like:\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>    - Click on the DocuSign link and review the contract in its entirety.\r\n>    - If you would like to negotiate or discuss changes with Derivative\r\n>    Path on the terms of your contract, please reach out to us.  If applicable,\r\n>    you will be notified again once the updated contract is ready for your\r\n>    review.\r\n>    - Once ready, please proceed with signing the contract in DocuSign.\r\n>    - Once the contract is signed you will be able to access a fully\r\n>    executed version in the Platform.  I will send you another email to outline\r\n>    the remaining steps for your onboarding (payroll enrollment, expenses,\r\n>    etc.).\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach out.\r\n>\r\n> Kind Regards,\r\n> Maria.\r\n>\r\n> Mar\u00eda Naredo\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Maria Naredo* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 13, 2026, 11:50 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> Thank you so much for completing your setup and uploading your documents.\r\n> Everything looks good!\r\n> I also want to thank you for your patience. We were finalizing your\r\n> employment contract with Derivative, and I expect it to be ready throughout\r\n> the day. I'll reach out with instructions on how to review it and sign it\r\n> very soon.\r\n>\r\n> Best,\r\n>\r\n> Mar\u00eda Naredo\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> *Aryan Thomare*\r\n>\r\n> Apr 11, 2026, 18:55 EDT\r\n> Hi Mar\u00eda,\r\n>\r\n> Thank you for reaching out! I submitted my documents a few days ago and\r\n> haven't heard anything back. Is there anything else I need to do for the\r\n> Internal verification?\r\n>\r\n> Thanks,\r\n> Aryan\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Maria Naredo* (Globalization Partners Help Center)\r\n>\r\n> Apr 1, 2026, 12:07 EDT\r\n> Hi Aryan,\r\n>\r\n> My name is Maria Naredo from the G-P Global HR Operations Team. As you may\r\n> know from *Derivative Path,* G-P will be your Employer of Record. This\r\n> means we will prepare your employment agreement, place you on our locally\r\n> compliant payroll, and assign your services to Derivative Path.\r\n>\r\n> To move forward with your employment agreement, please complete the\r\n> following steps.\r\n>\r\n> *Step 1: Complete Your G-P Platform Profile*\r\n> You will receive (or have received) an invitation to our secure G-P\r\n> Platform. Please log in and fill out the requested personal information.\r\n> You'll also need to upload valid documentation to prove you are eligible to\r\n> work in Canada.\r\n>\r\n> Valid documents include:\r\n>\r\n>    - Canadian Passport\r\n>    - Birth Certificate\r\n>    - Citizenship Card\r\n>    - Permanent Resident Card\r\n>    - Open Work Permit\r\n>\r\n> Please note: If you upload a document without a photo (like a Birth\r\n> Certificate), you must also upload a second form of ID with your photo\r\n> (e.g., passport, driver's license, or provincial health card). A driver's\r\n> license or provincial health card on its own is not sufficient for work\r\n> authorization.\r\n>\r\n> *Step 2: Confirm you have a Social Insurance Number (SIN)*\r\n> To legally work in Canada, you must have a valid 9-digit Social Insurance\r\n> Number (SIN). If you do not have one, please let me know right away. This\r\n> will be required during your payroll enrollment, after your contract has\r\n> been fully signed.\r\n>\r\n> *Next Steps*\r\n> Once you've completed your initial enrollment in the G-P Platform, here's\r\n> what happens next:\r\n> *Internal Verification: *The G-P team will quickly verify your\r\n> information, typically within 24 hours.\r\n> *Contract Review:* Once the verification is complete, you'll be notified\r\n> by email that your employment contract is ready for review and signature\r\n> via DocuSign. I will be available for any questions you may have throughout\r\n> the process.\r\n> I have attached the Onboarding Manual - Canada, which provides a detailed\r\n> guide to this entire process.\r\n>\r\n> Please let me know if you have any questions. I look forward to working\r\n> together to get you onboarded!\r\n>\r\n> Sincerely,\r\n>\r\n> Mar\u00eda Naredo\r\n> HR Specialist\r\n>\r\n> Upcoming OOO: Friday, April 3rd.\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Need Support?* *Access our Help Center*\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/en-us>\r\n> *98% customer satisfaction rating*\r\n> *Industry leading Global Employment Platform\u2122 according to Everest Group\r\n> and Nelson hall\r\n> <https://www.globalization-partners.com/resources/report-nelsonhall-neat-evaluation-global-employer-of-record-services/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=signature&utm_campaign=22q3_gbl_all_all_nelsonhallneat_report>*\r\n>\r\n> *This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and\r\n> intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are\r\n> addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the\r\n> sender immediately and delete this e-mail from your system. If you are not\r\n> the intended recipient you are notified that disclosing, copying,\r\n> distributing, or taking any action in reliance on the contents of this\r\n> information is strictly prohibited.*\r\n>\r\n> Attachment(s)\r\n> Canada_Onboarding_Manual_EN-Updated.pdf\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/attachments/token/byMFiTJ5S91ZKIg818PFbyqdT/?name=Canada_Onboarding_Manual_EN-Updated.pdf>\r\n>\r\n> The request (#810533\r\n> <https://globalization-partners.zendesk.com/hc/requests/810533>) has been\r\n> updated.\r\n> To add additional comments, reply to this email.\r\n> [ZPRG9M-4PYZW]\r\n>\r\n", "id": "lc_34cf8406-497f-4605-9fbb-d137ab9ad4ec"}]}}
