lank\" bgcolor=\"#0A66C2\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"mso-line-height-rule:exactly; text-align:center; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 20px; padding-right: 24px; padding-left: 24px; text-decoration: none; display: table-cell; height: 45px; border-radius: 50px; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: content-box\" _label=\"GET_YOUR_COPY\" _category=\"CTA\" ><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px;\">Get your copy&nbsp;now</span></span></a> <!--[if !mso]><!--></td>\r\n                                </tr>\r\n                              </table> <!--<![endif]-->\r\n                              <!--[if mso]>\r\n            </p></v:textbox>\r\n          </v:roundrect>\r\n        <![endif]-->\r\n                            </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                  </table>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </table>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\">\r\n      <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" width=\"512\" class=\"st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table\" style=\"width: 512px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 16px 33px;\">\r\n            <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\">\r\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"446\" class=\"st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width\" style=\"width: 446px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"446\">\r\n                        <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" class=\"aligned-bullets bullets-pb-12\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #191919; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-top: 4px; width: 100%;\">\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">Hi Aryan,</p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">&zwnj;<br /></p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">AI is creating a <strong>massive shift&nbsp;</strong>for every member of the global&nbsp;workforce.</p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">&zwnj;<br /></p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">In the <span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #0a66c2;\"><em><a href=\"https://t1.em.linkedin.com/r/?id=hecbf8c5c-87d3-49d3-a6bf-ad75ef8ce32b,7e2130,55d6b5&e=bWNpZD03NDUwNjUyNzcxMzk5MjI5NDQxJnRyaz1lbWwtbWt0Zy1icmFuZC1hd3ItMjAyNjA0LW5hbWVyLW9wZW4tdG8td29yay1ib29rLWVuLWVtbDMmc3JjPWUtZW1s&s=bt6xy25ILRG4LfyCL6mCuvsJkYBcmIBe9xPpShUG6VM\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #0a66c2;\" _label=\"OPEN_TO_WORK_1\" _category=\"CTA\" ><span style=\"color: #0a66c2; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Open to Work</span></strong></span></a></em></span> book, LinkedIn CEO Ryan&nbsp;Roslansky&nbsp;and Chief Economic Opportunity Officer Aneesh Raman <strong>cut through the noise</strong> to focus on what&nbsp;actually matters&nbsp;right now: <strong>adaptability,&nbsp;human ingenuity,&nbsp;and the courage</strong> to keep&nbsp;learning.&nbsp;</p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">&zwnj;<br /></p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">No&nbsp;buzzwords.&nbsp;Just practical, clear thinking about how to <strong>build real career optionality</strong> in an age of constant&nbsp;change.&nbsp;</p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">&zwnj;<br /></p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">Whether&nbsp;you&rsquo;re&nbsp;feeling hesitant,&nbsp;excited&nbsp;or&nbsp;maybe a&nbsp;mixture of both,&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #0a66c2;\"><em><a href=\"https://t1.em.linkedin.com/r/?id=hecbf8c5c-87d3-49d3-a6bf-ad75ef8ce32b,7e2130,55d6b6&e=bWNpZD03NDUwNjUyNzcxMzk5MjI5NDQxJnRyaz1lbWwtbWt0Zy1icmFuZC1hd3ItMjAyNjA0LW5hbWVyLW9wZW4tdG8td29yay1ib29rLWVuLWVtbDMmc3JjPWUtZW1s&s=AG1CEjsRgv0MS2ybcu6ZQKhvs9AjfKsx7-9vhutfmjY\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #0a66c2;\" _label=\"OPEN_TO_WORK_2\" _category=\"CTA\" ><span style=\"color: #0a66c2; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Open to Work</span></strong></span></a></em></span>&nbsp;is an&nbsp;<strong>encouraging guide</strong>&nbsp;for anyone <strong>navigating their next&nbsp;step</strong>.</p>\r\n                            </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                  </table>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\">\r\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"446\" class=\"st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width\" style=\"width: 446px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"446\">\r\n                        <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                  